The API description in spec/ and the recorded data in fixtures/ are shared by the four languages of the pDigger
Factory SDK (Go, Python, Rust, TypeScript). The API a pDigger Factory unit serves is eprojac's; its description in
spec/ is under the Apache License 2.0 like the rest of this repository. The real recordings come from a pDigger
Factory test unit or from an offline replay of its model's outputs, and the synthetic ones say so in their headers;
face keypoints, appearance masks and depth textures are removed from the real ones (see each recording's header).
crates/pdigger-factory-viz/src/topology.json is the unit's getTopology reply from fixtures/api.

docs/img/architecture.svg and docs/img/architecture.png are the architecture picture shared by the SDK's four languages.

